ow="run">Portfolio</span></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Clickable artwork images</span></p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Catalogue</span></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Artwork details and release dates</span></p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Gallery</span></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Photos and video link</span></p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">News</span></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Upcoming events</span></p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Newsletter</span></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Email stored in database</span></p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Store</span></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Order stored in database</span></p></td></tr><tr data-d-component="table-row"><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Contact</span></p></td><td data-d-component="table-cell" data-d-valign="start"><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run">Message stored in database</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="Edges-nCUHEi" style="left: 0px; top: 0px; width: 1307px; height: 369px;"></div></div><h2 class="TextBase-kDAqPL Title-ij922C" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"><strong class="Emphasis-BHzYtQ">Result</strong></span></h2><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);">Thus, the ArtistryHub artist portfolio website is developed using PHP, HTML, CSS, JavaScript and MySQL.</span></p><p class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"><strong class="Emphasis-BHzYtQ">Note:</strong></span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(237, 237, 237);"> The output preview is illustrative, and the code has not been tested in your XAMPP environment. The biography and career milestones are sample content. The store records orders without real payments, the newsletter stores subscriptions without sending emails, and the media gallery provides a general painting video link rather than verified artist interviews.</span></p></div></div></div><div class="contents"></div></div></div></div></div></div><span hidden=""></span></div></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none block h-0"></span><div class="actionRow-nqqZbm mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0 min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden disabled:opacity-40 aria-disabled:opacity-40 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-0 whitespace-nowrap flex border gap-1 rounded-full electron:rounded-md text-tertiary not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:hover:bg-secondary-ghost-hover data-[state=open]:bg-secondary-ghost-hover border-transparent [[data-control-group]_&amp;]:not-disabled:not-aria-disabled:active:bg-secondary-ghost-active electron:p-1 button-icon flex items-center justify-center p-0.5 [contain-intrinsic-size:var(--icon-size,